# This repository holds only what is needed to build, test and package
# OpenSpore. Everything else that may sit in a working folder (build output,
# local settings and saves, research notes, tools, and any file extracted
# from a Spore install) stays out: ignore everything, then list what is kept.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/installer/
!/src/

# Inside the kept folders
/installer/Output/
/src/+editor.rs

# OpenSpore ships no game files. Never commit Spore packages or anything
# extracted from them, wherever they end up.
*.package
*.wav
*.mp3
*.rw4
*.gmdl
*.obj
*.dds
*.png
*.bin
